      "name": "Death Burst",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [
        "occult"
      ],
      "description": "<p>When the bloodsiphon dies, its body explodes in a cloudy red burst of necrotic dried blood in a 20-foot area.</p>\n<p>Creatures in range must attempt a DC 21 Reflex save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d6</span> void damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">4d6</span> void damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">6d6</span> void damage and is Enfeebled 2 for 1 hour.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
  ],
